  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Run green, run clean! Step lightly and run responsibly with the ASICS Gel Nimbus 27. Designed for the warriors of the planet and tracks, these shoes help you take a giant leap toward a sustainable future. The upper material of these shoes is made with at least 75% recycled content to reduce waste and carbon emissions. The sockliner produced with the solution dyeing process reduces water usage by approximately 33% and carbon emissions by approximately 45% compared to conventional dyeing technology. The best part: the Flyte Foam Blast Plus ECO midsole provides lightweight cushioning and softer landings. Conquer miles while conserving Mother Nature with the ASICS Gel Nimbus 27.</p> <p><strong>ASICS Gel Nimbus 27 </strong><strong>features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Engineered jacquard mesh wraps the foot with a soft feel and delivers breathability.</li> <li>OrthoLite X-55 sockliner improves step-in comfort.</li> <li>PureGEL technology provides lightweight cushioning and softer landings.</li> <li>Reflective details improve visibility in low-light conditions.</li> <li>Hybrid ASICSGRIP outsole rubber creates better traction, improved softness, and advanced durability.</li> <li>Weight: 9.5 oz.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Comfort matters when the miles add up, and the ASICS GEL-Nimbus 27 is built to keep every stride soft, smooth, and supported. This max-cushioned running shoe pairs a breathable engineered jacquard mesh upper with a plush underfoot feel, while PureGEL technology and FF BLAST PLUS ECO cushioning help soften impact for a more effortless ride. Recycled materials in the upper and a solution-dyed sockliner add a more thoughtful finish to your daily training rotation.</p><ul><li>Engineered jacquard mesh upper delivers breathable comfort.</li><li>FF BLAST PLUS ECO midsole provides lightweight cushioning.</li><li>PureGEL technology helps create softer landings.</li><li>OrthoLite X-55 sockliner enhances step-in comfort.</li><li>Reflective details help improve low-light visibility.</li><li>Hybrid ASICSGRIP outsole adds traction, softness, and durability.</li><li>Weight: 9.5 oz.</li></ul>  <p><strong>Cushioning &amp; Road Feel</strong></p><p>Made for runners who want a highly cushioned ride, the GEL-Nimbus 27 helps smooth out everyday miles with a soft, protective feel underfoot. The platform feels substantial without losing comfort, and the outsole is built to keep you moving confidently on road runs and daily wear alike.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-Nimbus 27 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Lake Grey/White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1012B753-002</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">ASICS® Size Guide &amp; C